    <item>
      <title>[Linux] 镜像源</title>
      <link>https://byzhrichard.github.io/post/linux/%E9%95%9C%E5%83%8F%E6%BA%90/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 00:00:00 &#43;0000</pubDate>
      <author>xxx@example.com (byzh)</author>
      <guid>https://byzhrichard.github.io/post/linux/%E9%95%9C%E5%83%8F%E6%BA%90/</guid>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<h1>[Linux] 镜像源</h1><p>作者：byzh（xxx@example.com）</p>
        
          <h1 id="镜像源">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e9%95%9c%e5%83%8f%e6%ba%90"></a>
镜像源
</h1><h2 id="1-pip">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#1-pip"></a>
1. pip
</h2><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip config set global.index-url https://pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/simple
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip config set global.extra-index-url https://mirrors.aliyun.com/pypi/simple
</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="2-conda">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#2-conda"></a>
2. conda
</h2><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">conda config --set show_channel_urls yes
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>替换.condarc文件：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">channels:
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  - defaults
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">show_channel_urls: true
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">default_channels:
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  - https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/anaconda/pkgs/main
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  - https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/anaconda/pkgs/r
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  - https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/anaconda/pkgs/msys2
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">custom_channels:
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  conda-forge: https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/anaconda/cloud
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  msys2: https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/anaconda/cloud
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  bioconda: https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/anaconda/cloud
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  menpo: https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/anaconda/cloud
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  pytorch: https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/anaconda/cloud
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  pytorch-lts: https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/anaconda/cloud
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  simpleitk: https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/anaconda/cloud
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  deepmodeling: https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/anaconda/cloud/
</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="3-uv">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#3-uv"></a>
3. uv
</h2><h4 id="项目级---pyprojecttoml">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e9%a1%b9%e7%9b%ae%e7%ba%a7---pyprojecttoml"></a>
项目级 - <code>pyproject.toml</code>
</h4><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-toml" data-lang="toml"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">[</span><span class="nx">tool</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nx">uv</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nx">sources</span><span class="p">]</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nx">torch</span> <span class="p">=</span> <span class="p">[</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="p">{</span> <span class="nx">index</span> <span class="p">=</span> <span class="s2">&#34;pytorch-cu117&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="nx">marker</span> <span class="p">=</span> <span class="s2">&#34;sys_platform == &#39;linux&#39; or sys_platform == &#39;win32&#39;&#34;</span> <span class="p">},</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">]</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nx">torchvision</span> <span class="p">=</span> <span class="p">[</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="p">{</span> <span class="nx">index</span> <span class="p">=</span> <span class="s2">&#34;pytorch-cu117&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="nx">marker</span> <span class="p">=</span> <span class="s2">&#34;sys_platform == &#39;linux&#39; or sys_platform == &#39;win32&#39;&#34;</span> <span class="p">},</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">]</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nx">torchaudio</span> <span class="p">=</span> <span class="p">[</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="p">{</span> <span class="nx">index</span> <span class="p">=</span> <span class="s2">&#34;pytorch-cu117&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="nx">marker</span> <span class="p">=</span> <span class="s2">&#34;sys_platform == &#39;linux&#39; or sys_platform == &#39;win32&#39;&#34;</span> <span class="p">},</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">]</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">[[</span><span class="nx">tool</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nx">uv</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nx">index</span><span class="p">]]</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nx">name</span> <span class="p">=</span> <span class="s2">&#34;pytorch-cu117&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c"># url = &#34;https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu117&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nx">url</span> <span class="p">=</span> <span class="s2">&#34;https://mirror.sjtu.edu.cn/pytorch-wheels/cu117/&#34;</span> <span class="c"># 上交源</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nx">explicit</span> <span class="p">=</span> <span class="kc">true</span> <span class="c"># 表示 只有在 [tool.uv.sources] 明确指定了这个索引源的包，才会使用这个源</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">[[</span><span class="nx">tool</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nx">uv</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nx">index</span><span class="p">]]</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c"># url = &#34;https://pypi.org/simple&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nx">url</span> <span class="p">=</span> <span class="s2">&#34;https://mirrors.aliyun.com/pypi/simple&#34;</span> <span class="c"># 阿里源</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nx">default</span> <span class="p">=</span> <span class="kc">true</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="用户级">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e7%94%a8%e6%88%b7%e7%ba%a7"></a>
用户级
</h2><p>python下载的镜像源</p>
        
        <hr><p>本文2026-09-08首发于<a href='https://byzhrichard.github.io/'>byzh的博客</a>，最后修改于2026-09-08</p>]]>
      </description>
      
        <category>Linux</category>
      
    </item>
    
    

