    <item>
      <title>[Linux] 安装uv</title>
      <link>https://byzhrichard.github.io/post/linux/%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85uv/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:00:00 &#43;0000</pubDate>
      <author>xxx@example.com (byzh)</author>
      <guid>https://byzhrichard.github.io/post/linux/%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85uv/</guid>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<h1>[Linux] 安装uv</h1><p>作者：byzh（xxx@example.com）</p>
        
          <h1 id="安装uv">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%85uv"></a>
安装uv
</h1><h4 id="1-进入tmp下载uv">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#1-%e8%bf%9b%e5%85%a5tmp%e4%b8%8b%e8%bd%bduv"></a>
1. 进入tmp下载uv
</h4><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-gdscript3" data-lang="gdscript3"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">cd</span> <span class="o">/</span><span class="n">tmp</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">wget</span> <span class="n">https</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="o">//</span><span class="n">github</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">com</span><span class="o">/</span><span class="n">astral</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">sh</span><span class="o">/</span><span class="n">uv</span><span class="o">/</span><span class="n">releases</span><span class="o">/</span><span class="n">download</span><span class="o">/</span><span class="mf">0.12</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="mi">9</span><span class="o">/</span><span class="n">uv</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">x86_64</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">unknown</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">linux</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">gnu</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">tar</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">gz</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>
<p>官方: <code>wget https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/releases/download/0.12.9/uv-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz</code></p>
<p>加速: <code>wget https://gh-proxy.com/https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/releases/download/0.12.9/uv-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz</code></p>
</blockquote>
<h4 id="2-解压">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#2-%e8%a7%a3%e5%8e%8b"></a>
2. 解压
</h4><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">tar -zxvf uv-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">cd uv-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu
</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>
<table>
  <thead>
      <tr>
          <th style="text-align: left"><strong>参数</strong></th>
          <th style="text-align: left"><strong>全称</strong></th>
          <th style="text-align: left"><strong>作用</strong></th>
      </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
      <tr>
          <td style="text-align: left"><code>-z</code></td>
          <td style="text-align: left"><code>--gzip</code></td>
          <td style="text-align: left">告诉 tar：这个包是用 <strong>gzip</strong> 压缩的（因为是 <code>.tar.gz</code>）</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td style="text-align: left"><code>-x</code></td>
          <td style="text-align: left"><code>--extract</code></td>
          <td style="text-align: left"><strong>解压/提取</strong>文件（和打包 <code>-c</code> 相对）</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td style="text-align: left"><code>-v</code></td>
          <td style="text-align: left"><code>--verbose</code></td>
          <td style="text-align: left"><strong>显示过程</strong>：把正在解压的文件名打印到终端</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td style="text-align: left"><code>-f</code></td>
          <td style="text-align: left"><code>--file</code></td>
          <td style="text-align: left">指定<strong>文件名</strong>，后面必须紧跟 tar 包名</td>
      </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
</blockquote>
<h4 id="3-移动到-usrlocalbin-下">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#3-%e7%a7%bb%e5%8a%a8%e5%88%b0-usrlocalbin-%e4%b8%8b"></a>
3. 移动到 <code>/usr/local/bin</code> 下
</h4><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo cp uv /usr/local/bin
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo cp uvx /usr/local/bin
</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id="4-检查安装">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#4-%e6%a3%80%e6%9f%a5%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%85"></a>
4. 检查安装
</h4><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">uv --version
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">uvx --version
</span></span></code></pre></div><h1 id="sh">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#sh"></a>
sh
</h1><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="cp">#!/bin/bash
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 使用方法: ./install_uv.sh 0.12.9</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 传入参数</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nv">VERSION</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="si">${</span><span class="nv">1</span><span class="k">:-</span><span class="nv">0</span><span class="p">.12.9</span><span class="si">}</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">cd</span> /tmp
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">wget https://gh-proxy.com/https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/releases/download/<span class="si">${</span><span class="nv">VERSION</span><span class="si">}</span>/uv-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">tar -zxvf uv-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">cd</span> uv-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo cp uv /usr/local/bin
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo cp uvx /usr/local/bin
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">uv --version
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">uvx --version
</span></span></code></pre></div>
        
